649 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 597 0 R
/T (The landscape of patient engagement has evolved significantly, driven by advancements in digital health and a growing focus on personalized patient experiences. As we enter 2026, pharmaceutical and med-tech companies face increasing pressure to improve patient adherence, retention, and satisfaction through innovative strategies that go beyond traditional methods. The success of leading companies shows that understanding patient sentiment, embracing personalized support, and implementing real-time engagement are key to driving better outcomes. To help organizations stay competitive, this report provides a comprehensive analysis of the current state of patient engagement, offering benchmarking data, insights into emerging trends, and practical strategies for improvement. By leveraging patient sentiment data and insights gained through patient connections and mentorship journeys, companies can achieve above-average performance and establish themselves as leaders in patient-centric healthcare.)
/E (The landscape of patient engagement has evolved significantly, driven by advancements in digital health and a growing focus on personalized patient experiences. As we enter 2026, pharmaceutical and med-tech companies face increasing pressure to improve patient adherence, retention, and satisfaction through innovative strategies that go beyond traditional methods. The success of leading companies shows that understanding patient sentiment, embracing personalized support, and implementing real-time engagement are key to driving better outcomes. To help organizations stay competitive, this report provides a comprehensive analysis of the current state of patient engagement, offering benchmarking data, insights into emerging trends, and practical strategies for improvement. By leveraging patient sentiment data and insights gained through patient connections and mentorship journeys, companies can achieve above-average performance and establish themselves as leaders in patient-centric healthcare.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
